Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260421094735.20997-1-andrea.mayer@uniroma2.it
	Signed-off-by: Paolo Abeni <pabeni@redhat.com>
(cherry picked from commit f9c52a6ba9780bd27e0bf4c044fd91c13c778b6e)
